  "_comment": "Z-Image Turbo - OUTPAINT. ImagePadForOutpaint adds canvas (left/top/right/bottom in px, multiples of 8) and builds the mask for the new area; VAEEncodeForInpaint then lets the model fill it at denoise 1.0. Prompt should describe the whole scene including what belongs in the extension. Extend a little at a time for best seams. Default input image is example.png (bundled ComfyUI sample); override with run_workflow.py --input-image image=<your file>."
}